{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/4ed029cf284c4ddb7a165102ea327959.poster.avif?t=1773935445\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/4ed029cf284c4ddb7a165102ea327959.webm?t=1773935445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/4ed029cf284c4ddb7a165102ea327959.mp4?t=1773935445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br>Two magical girls discover a latent power within you... and now they want to steal magic energy from you to use for their own selfish purposes.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/3973e26268836129c8f0aefd0d701787.webp?t=1773935445\" alt=\"Ruby\" width=615 height=52 /></span></p>The pure-hearted heroine will destroy evil... when it's convenient for her. She puts on a show for fans and supporters, but secretly cares only about her growing popularity, and is willing to commit all kinds of vile crimes to remain famous.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/521b97ec4b7791f2424e9a9fa3363b3c.poster.avif?t=1773935445\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/521b97ec4b7791f2424e9a9fa3363b3c.webm?t=1773935445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/521b97ec4b7791f2424e9a9fa3363b3c.mp4?t=1773935445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/c73b91100135aaf5ef0ef4700d006b5a.webp?t=1773935445\" alt=\"Noire\" width=615 height=52 /></span><br>This wicked and selfish villainess doesn't care about her reputation so long as she gets her way! Kidnapping, grand theft, and even murder?! She'll do it all to further her selfish goals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/bf191375f71e6d35260f6ca7fa740a5e.poster.avif?t=1773935445\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/bf191375f71e6d35260f6ca7fa740a5e.webm?t=1773935445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/bf191375f71e6d35260f6ca7fa740a5e.mp4?t=1773935445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>These two girls fight over your &quot;love&quot;, draining your latent magic out of you with their tempting bodies, all with the aim of turning you into their toy, and a dehumanized tool to fight each other for dominance and rule the city as the victor...<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/668aa8e24a17c371bdc89ca409252190.poster.avif?t=1773935445\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/668aa8e